<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Yasuo Delayed Tornado Macro Script</Major>
    <Description>Description
This macro script is designed for the game "League of Legends," specifically for the character Yasuo. The macro automates the execution of a combo sequence to unleash Yasuo's delayed tornado attack efficiently.

Features
Automated Combo Execution: With a single press of the macro activation key, Yasuo will perform the E-Q-B-A combo sequence.
Cursor Targeting: The macro initiates the combo where your mouse cursor is pointing, allowing for precise targeting of opponents.
Delayed Tornado Release: After executing the combo, you have a two-second window to perform a basic attack on a target, which will then release the delayed tornado.
How to Use
Positioning: Hover your mouse cursor over the intended target in the game.
Activation: Press the designated key to activate the macro.
Finalize: Within two seconds, perform a basic attack on any target to release the delayed tornado.
Requirements
The macro script is designed to work on a standard PC setup running "League of Legends."
Ensure you have the necessary in-game settings and keybindings configured to match the macro's requirements.
Disclaimer
Macros are often against the Terms of Service of many online games, including "League of Legends." Use this script at your own risk.
The creator of this macro assumes no responsibility for any actions taken against the user's game account as a result of using this macro.</Description>
